  "details": "Description\n\nThird-person camera moves diagonally if you rotate using the < and > key buttons after pressing Tab key. I don't know if this is a bug or not, but it looks wrong.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Enable Third-Person View with F5 key button\n\n2. Press Tab key button\n\n3. Rotate camera with < or > key buttons\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p1-1920-5a72154dad-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR",
